abstract: "Code, configurations and raw result archives for a comparison of conditional VAE and conditional WGAN-GP as view generators in generative-augmented contrastive pretraining for network intrusion detection, evaluated on NSL-KDD and UNSW-NB15. The first submission's code was not preserved; all reported numbers come from this clean PyTorch re-implementation."
